{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "group-env",
      "type": "group",
      "x": -40,
      "y": -60,
      "width": 680,
      "height": 1120,
      "color": "5",
      "label": "1. Environment & Dual Inputs (Rust PyO3 -> Gymnasium v3.0)"
    },
    {
      "id": "env-sim",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 600,
      "height": 220,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "### Rust Simulation Core & Single-Army Gym Wrapper\n- **Files**: `crates/coc-engine/src/sim.rs`, `crates/coc-py/src/lib.rs`, `python/coc_rl/envs.py`\n- **Classes**: `BattleEngine` -> `PyBattleEnv` -> `CoCAttackerEnv`\n- **Single-Army Specialist**: Each model trains on 1 dedicated `ArmyLoadout` across 5 TH18 reference villages (`{army_slug}_ep{N}_{pct}pct_{stars}star.pt`), exporting the full `army` in the checkpoint.\n- **Step Resolution**: `ticks_per_step = 8` (`0.8s` simulated combat per RL decision; max `120` steps)"
    },
    {
      "id": "obs-tensor",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 250,
      "width": 600,
      "height": 410,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "### Input 1: 31-Channel Spatial Grid `(B, 31, 50, 50)` + Input 2: `army_context (B, 64)`\n1. **`obs (B, 31, 50, 50)`** (`BattleEngine::extract_spatial_observation()`):\n   - `Ch 0..9`: Building HP, Defense DPS, TH18 Mask, Wall HP, Red Zone, Ground/Air Attacker HP, Active Spells, Allied & Enemy Unit Archetypes $\\phi(u) \\in [0, 1]$\n   - `Ch 10..30` (**21 Per-Defense Channels**): `ArcherTower (10)`, `MultiArcherTower (11)`, `RicochetCannon (12)`, `Cannon (13)`, `Mortar (14)`, `AirDefense (15)`, `WizardTower (16)`, `SuperWizardTower (17)`, `AirSweeper (18, dir)`, `HiddenTesla (19, revealed)`, `BombTower (20)`, `XBow (21, mode)`, `InfernoTower (22, mode)`, `Scattershot (23)`, `BuildersHut (24)`, `SpellTower (25, mode)`, `Monolith (26)`, `MultiGearTower (27, mode)`, `Firespitter (28, dir)`, `RevengeTower (29)`, `HotCandle (30)`\n2. **`army_context (B, 64)`** (`BattleEngine::extract_army_context()`):\n   - Encodes what troops, spells, heroes, equipment abilities, and siege machine are still available and in what remaining quantity (depleted slots zeroed out)."
    },
    {
      "id": "action-masks",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 690,
      "width": 600,
      "height": 340,
      "color": "3",
      "text": "### Input 3: Dynamic Two-Phase Action Masks (`get_action_masks`)\nBoolean masks emitted every step by `CoCAttackerEnv`:\n\n1. **`slot_type` `(B, 7)`**:\n   - `0`: `NoOp` (Wait)\n   - `1`: `DeployTroop` (`any(remaining_troops > 0)`)\n   - `2`: `DeployHero` (unlocked after $\\ge 3$ frontline troop waves)\n   - `3`: `ActivateHeroAbility` (`tick >= 64`, `16`-tick spacing)\n   - `4`: `DeploySiege` (unlocked after $\\ge 1$ frontline troop wave)\n   - `5`: `PopSiegeMachine` (`tick >= 112`, active siege alive)\n   - `6`: `CastSpell` (`tick >= 40`, `8`-tick spacing, TH halo protected)\n2. **`slot_idx` `(B, 7, 10)`**: Per-category valid loadout slot mask (`0..9`)\n3. **`tile` `(B, 2500)`**: Exterior cardinal perimeter funnel (`!no_deploy_mask`)"
    },
    {
      "id": "group-backbone",
      "type": "group",
      "x": 740,
      "y": -60,
      "width": 680,
      "height": 1120,
      "color": "4",
      "label": "2. Dual-Pathway Spatial CNN Backbone & Inventory Fusion"
    },
    {
      "id": "spatial-stem",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 780,
      "y": 20,
      "width": 600,
      "height": 270,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "### 2A. Dilated Spatial Stem (`self.spatial_stem`)\n**File**: `python/coc_rl/networks.py` (`CoCSpatialEncoder`)\nPreserves full `50x50` grid coordinates with dilated $3\\times 3$ filters:\n\n```text\nInput: (B, 31, 50, 50)\n  -> Conv2d(31 -> 64, k=3, pad=2, dilation=2, bias=False) + GroupNorm(4, 64) + SiLU\n  -> Conv2d(64 -> 64, k=3, pad=2, dilation=2, bias=False) + GroupNorm(4, 64) + SiLU\n  -> Conv2d(64 -> 128, k=3, pad=1, dilation=1, bias=False) + GroupNorm(8, 128) + SiLU\nOutput h: (B, 128, 50, 50)\n```"
    },
    {
      "id": "context-res",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 780,
      "y": 330,
      "width": 600,
      "height": 280,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "### 2B. Residual Context Block (`self.context_res`)\nExpands receptive field to $15\\times 15$ across TH18 compartments while keeping exact 1-to-1 tile alignment:\n\n```text\nh: (B, 128, 50, 50)\n  -> Conv2d(128 -> 128, k=3, pad=1, bias=False) + GroupNorm(8, 128) + SiLU\n  -> Conv2d(128 -> 128, k=3, pad=1, bias=False) + GroupNorm(8, 128)\n  -> SiLU(h + context_res(h))\n```\n**Output 1 (`spatial_features`)**: **`(B, 128, 50, 50)`**"
    },
    {
      "id": "global-tower",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 780,
      "y": 650,
      "width": 600,
      "height": 380,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "### 2C. Global Tower + `army_context_proj` Fusion\nDownsamples `spatial_features` and fuses with live available inventory `army_context (B, 64)`:\n\n```text\nspatial_features: (B, 128, 50, 50)\n  -> Conv2d(128 -> 96, k=3, stride=2, p=1) + SiLU      # (B, 96, 25, 25)\n  -> Conv2d(96 -> 128, k=3, stride=2, p=1) + SiLU      # (B, 128, 13, 13)\n  -> AdaptiveAvgPool2d((4, 4)) -> Flatten()            # (B, 2048)\n  -> Linear(2048 -> 256) + LayerNorm(256) + SiLU       # g_spatial (B, 256)\n\ng_army = SiLU(LayerNorm(Linear(64 -> 256)(army_context)))\nglobal_emb = g_spatial + g_army                        # (B, 256)\n```"
    },
    {
      "id": "group-actor-critic",
      "type": "group",
      "x": 1520,
      "y": -60,
      "width": 960,
      "height": 1460,
      "color": "6",
      "label": "3. Autoregressive 5-Head Factorized Actor-Critic (CoCActorCritic)"
    },
    {
      "id": "head-slot-type",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1560,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 880,
      "height": 250,
      "color": "6",
      "text": "### Head 1: Action Category Head (`slot_type_head`)\nDecides **what kind of action** to perform (`0..6`):\n- **Layer**: `1.4 * tanh(Linear(256 -> 7)(global_emb) / 3.0)`\n- **Logit Masking**: `type_logits.masked_fill(~masks['slot_type'], -1e8)`\n- **Output**: `chosen_type` $\\in \\{0..6\\}$ (`0=NoOp, 1=Troop, 2=Hero, 3=HeroAbility, 4=Siege, 5=PopSiege, 6=Spell`)"
    },
    {
      "id": "cond-fusion",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1560,
      "y": 290,
      "width": 880,
      "height": 200,
      "color": "6",
      "text": "### Autoregressive Conditioning (`cond_emb` & `frac_cond_emb`)\nDownstream heads condition on `chosen_type` and `chosen_idx`:\n```python\ntype_onehot = F.one_hot(chosen_type, num_classes=7).float()   # (B, 7)\ncond_emb = torch.cat([global_emb, type_onehot], dim=-1)       # (B, 263)\nidx_onehot = F.one_hot(chosen_idx, num_classes=10).float()    # (B, 10)\nfrac_cond_emb = torch.cat([cond_emb, idx_onehot], dim=-1)     # (B, 273)\n```"
    },
    {
      "id": "head-slot-idx",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1560,
      "y": 530,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 310,
      "color": "6",
      "text": "### Head 2 & Head 3: Slot Index (`slot_idx_head`) & Wave Fraction (`deploy_fraction_head`)\n- **Head 2 (`slot_idx_head`)**: `MLP(263 -> 128 -> 10)` masked by `masks['slot_idx'][b, chosen_type]` $\\to$ `chosen_idx` $\\in \\{0..9\\}$\n- **Head 3 (`deploy_fraction_head`)**: `MLP(273 -> 128 -> 5)` over wave bins $\\alpha \\in \\{0.0, 0.25, 0.50, 0.75, 1.00\\}$ $\\to$ deploys $\\max(1, \\text{round}(\\alpha \\cdot N_{\\text{avail}}))$ troops at once!"
    },
    {
      "id": "head-tile",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2020,
      "y": 530,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 310,
      "color": "6",
      "text": "### Head 4: FiLM Spatial Tile Pointer (`tile_conv_head`)\nSelects **where on the `50x50` map** to deploy or cast:\n1. `c = Linear(263 -> 128)(cond_emb).view(B, 128, 1, 1)`\n2. `fused = SiLU(spatial_feat * (1 + 0.5 * tanh(c)) + c)` `(B, 128, 50, 50)`\n3. `Conv2d(128 -> 32, k=3, p=1) -> SiLU -> Conv2d(32 -> 1, k=1)` + `spatial_prior` `(B, 2500)`"
    },
    {
      "id": "head-critic",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1560,
      "y": 880,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 220,
      "color": "6",
      "text": "### Head 5: State-Value Critic (`critic_head`)\nEstimates expected discounted return $V(s_t)$ from fused `global_emb`:\n- **MLP**: `Linear(256 -> 128) -> SiLU -> Linear(128 -> 1)` (`2.5x` Actor LR)\n- **Output**: Scalar `value` `(B,)`"
    },
    {
      "id": "actor-output",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2020,
      "y": 880,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 480,
      "color": "6",
      "text": "### Factorized Output & Normalized Per-Head Entropy\n**1. Action Tensor `(B, 5)`**:\n`[chosen_type, chosen_idx, tile_x, tile_y, chosen_frac_bin]`\n\n**2. Relevance Masks**:\n- `uses_idx = chosen_type in {1, 2, 3, 6}`\n- `uses_frac = chosen_type == 1`\n- `uses_tile = chosen_type in {1, 2, 4, 6}`\n\n**3. Normalized Per-Head Regularization (`reg_entropy`)**:\n```python\nreg_entropy = (\n    2.2 * (H_type / 1.9459)\n    + 2.2 * (uses_idx * H_idx / 2.3026)\n    + 2.2 * (uses_frac * H_frac / 1.6094)\n    + 0.12 * (uses_tile * H_tile / 6.7429)\n)\n```"
    },
    {
      "id": "group-ppo",
      "type": "group",
      "x": 2580,
      "y": -60,
      "width": 760,
      "height": 1460,
      "color": "2",
      "label": "4. Single-Army PPO Training Loop, 100-Pt Reward & GAE"
    },
    {
      "id": "rollout-step",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2620,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 680,
      "height": 280,
      "color": "2",
      "text": "### 4A. Single-Army Trajectory Rollout (`train_pytorch_ppo`)\n**File**: `python/train_ai.py`\n- Trains on 1 dedicated army composition across the selected TH18 village layouts (`batch_episodes = 12`, `minibatch_size = 128`)\n- Stores `(obs, army_context, action, old_logprob, value, reward, done, masks)` per step\n- Saves checkpoint to `trained_models/{army_slug}_ep{N}_{pct}pct_{stars}star.pt` with full exported `army` metadata"
    },
    {
      "id": "reward-shaping",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2620,
      "y": 320,
      "width": 680,
      "height": 310,
      "color": "2",
      "text": "### 4B. Calibrated 100-Point Reward Shaping (`compute_custom_reward_components`)\n**File**: `python/coc_rl/ppo.py`\n\n$$R_t = 0.35 \\cdot \\Delta\\%_{\\text{destr}} + 15.0 \\cdot \\Delta\\text{HP}_{\\text{ratio}} + 12.0 \\cdot \\Delta\\text{stars} + 14.0 \\cdot \\mathbb{I}_{\\text{TH18}} + 0.08 \\cdot C_{\\text{funnel}} - 0.05 \\cdot \\mathbb{I}_{\\text{invalid}}$$\n\n- **Destruction + Core HP**: `35.0 pts` max destruction + `15.0 pts` continuous HP damage\n- **Stars + TH18 Takedown**: `36.0 pts` for 3 stars + `14.0 pts` TH18 takedown bonus"
    },
    {
      "id": "gae-calc",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2620,
      "y": 670,
      "width": 680,
      "height": 290,
      "color": "2",
      "text": "### 4C. Generalized Advantage Estimation (`compute_gae`)\n**File**: `python/coc_rl/ppo.py`\nBootstraps from terminal/next value $V(s_{T})$ in reverse time ($t = T-1 \\dots 0$) with $\\gamma = 0.99, \\lambda = 0.95$:\n\n$$\\delta_t = r_t + \\gamma V(s_{t+1})(1 - d_t) - V(s_t)$$\n$$\\hat{A}_t = \\delta_t + \\gamma \\lambda (1 - d_t) \\hat{A}_{t+1}$$\n$$R_t = \\hat{A}_t + V(s_t)$$"
    },
    {
      "id": "ppo-update",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2620,
      "y": 1000,
      "width": 680,
      "height": 360,
      "color": "2",
      "text": "### 4D. Shuffled Minibatch PPO Update (`ppo_minibatch_update`)\n**File**: `python/coc_rl/ppo.py`\nRuns `ppo_epochs = 4` shuffled minibatch updates (`Adam`, Actor `lr = 3e-4`, Critic `lr = 7.5e-4`, `target_kl = 0.03`):\n\n1. Re-evaluate `new_logprob, entropy, new_value, diag` on `(mb_obs, mb_masks, mb_act, mb_ctx)`\n2. Normalize advantages across the rollout buffer\n3. Clipped Surrogate Loss ($\\epsilon = 0.2, c_v = 0.5, c_e = 0.015$):\n   $$\\mathcal{L}_\\text{total} = \\mathcal{L}_{\\text{CLIP}}(\\theta) + 0.5 \\cdot \\frac{1}{2}\\text{MSE}(V_\\theta, R) - 0.015 \\cdot \\mathcal{H}_{\\text{reg}}(\\pi_\\theta)$$"
    },
    {
      "id": "group-torchview",
      "type": "group",
      "x": 1520,
      "y": 1460,
      "width": 1820,
      "height": 1180,
      "color": "4",
      "label": "5. Auto-Synced Torchview Computation Graphs (docs/architecture/)"
    },
    {
      "id": "torchview-summary",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1560,
      "y": 1520,
      "width": 520,
      "height": 440,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "### Live Network Telemetry & Torchview Sync (`v3.0`)\n- **Total Parameters**: **`1,364,344`** (`input_shape = [(1, 31, 50, 50), (1, 64)]`)\n\n| Submodule | Layer Type | Params |\n| :--- | :--- | ---: |\n| `encoder.spatial_stem` | `Sequential` | `128,960` |\n| `encoder.context_res` | `Sequential` | `295,424` |\n| `encoder.global_tower` | `Sequential` | `746,464` |\n| `army_context_proj` | `Sequential` | `17,152` |\n| `slot_type_head` | `Linear` | `1,799` |\n| `slot_idx_head` | `Sequential` | `35,082` |\n| `deploy_fraction_head` | `Sequential` | `35,717` |\n| `tile_cond_proj` | `Linear` | `33,792` |\n| `tile_conv_head` | `Sequential` | `36,929` |\n| `critic_head` | `Sequential` | `33,025` |"
    },
    {
      "id": "torchview-overview-img",
      "type": "file",
      "file": "docs/architecture/coc_actor_critic_overview.png",
      "x": 2120,
      "y": 1520,
      "width": 560,
      "height": 1080,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "torchview-detailed-img",
      "type": "file",
      "file": "docs/architecture/coc_actor_critic_detailed.png",
      "x": 2720,
      "y": 1520,
      "width": 580,
      "height": 1080,
      "color": "4"
    }
  ],
